  "readmeExcerpt": "# @open-mercato/events 📡\n\nEvent-driven backbone for Open Mercato modules.\n\n`@open-mercato/events` enables typed event publication/subscription with support for ephemeral and persistent delivery patterns.\n\n## Why this package ✨\n\n- 🧩 Decouple modules with clean event contracts\n- 🔁 Persistent subscribers for reliable side effects\n- ⚡ Ephemeral events for real-time UX flows\n- 🧠 Works with queue workers for scalable processing\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\nyarn add @open-mercato/events\n```\n\n## Learn more\n\n- GitHub (package): https://github.com/open-mercato/open-mercato/tree/main/packages/events\n- GitHub (project): https://github.com/open-mercato/open-mercato\n- Docs: https://docs.openmercato.com\n\n## License\n\nMIT\n",
